1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,307
So stock six carps that feed in different places.

2
00:00:03,307 --> 00:00:10,703
Silver carp at the surface eats phytoplankton; catla, also near the surface, eats zooplankton.

3
00:00:10,703 --> 00:00:12,617
Rohu feeds in the column.

4
00:00:12,617 --> 00:00:15,651
Grass carp eats the weeds at the margins.

5
00:00:15,651 --> 00:00:18,606
Mrigal and common carp work the bottom.

6
00:00:18,606 --> 00:00:21,966
The same pond feeds them all, and the yield jumps.

